/vendor/
/.env
/.phpunit.cache/
# Nothing the watcher WRITES is tracked — not the reports, not the provider
# state they are diffed against. The cron rewrites both on every run, so
# tracking them leaves the working tree permanently dirty and fills history
# with machine noise rather than decisions.
#
# The cost, stated so nobody rediscovers it: a fresh clone starts with no
# baseline, so its first run reports every model and release as new. That is
# one noisy report, not lost data — the second run is accurate.
#
# Both directories are recreated on demand (SnapshotStore, FileDriftDispatcher
# both mkdir recursively), so neither needs to exist in the repo.
/reports/
/state/
*.log
